VLCKit (libVLC), with the VLC modules it bundles, version 4.0.0-a25
  License: GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later (LGPL-2.1-or-later)
  Source:  https://code.videolan.org/videolan/VLCKit (tag 4.0.0-a25)
           https://code.videolan.org/videolan/vlc (libVLC)
  Used for RTSP playback. The prebuilt framework is downloaded by Swift Package Manager from
  VideoLAN and is not modified. The libraries bundled inside VLCKit carry their own (LGPL or
  more permissive) licenses; VideoLAN lists them with the package.
  LGPL relinking: the LGPL lets you replace the library with a modified version. Because the
  complete source of CamGrid is public, you can rebuild the app yourself against a modified
  VLCKit: change the VLCKit package in iosApp/project.yml (or point it to a local package) and
  build as described in docs/ios.md. Anyone distributing a CamGrid build must keep it possible
  to obtain this source.

